{"tool_slug":"NOTION_ADD_MULTIPLE_PAGE_CONTENT","arguments":{"parent_block_id":"391f85d3-4899-81ba-ae3e-ee2f27fc6d8d","content_blocks":[{"content_block":{"content":"# 22_AI_e_Prompt_Engineering","block_property":"paragraph"}},{"content_block":{"content":"📋 Panoramica","block_property":"heading_2"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Intelligenza Artificiale e Prompt Engineering. Copre i fondamenti dell'AI, machine learning, deep learning, modelli linguistici (LLM), tecniche di prompt engineering e applicazioni pratiche nell'ecosistema cloud e DevOps.","block_property":"paragraph"}},{"content_block":{"content":"> ⚠️ **Nessun materiale didattico presente** in `01_Materiale/`. Questa nota è un placeholder da integrare.","block_property":"paragraph"}},{"content_block":{"content":"📚 Indice degli argomenti (attesi dal syllabus)","block_property":"heading_2"}},{"content_block":{"content":"1. Fondamenti di AI/ML","block_property":"heading_3"}},{"content_block":{"content":"AI, Machine Learning, Deep Learning — differenze e relazioni","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Apprendimento supervisionato, non supervisionato, per rinforzo","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Bias, varianza, overfitting, underfitting","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"2. Modelli Linguistici (LLM)","block_property":"heading_3"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Architettura Transformer (Self-attention, Multi-head attention)","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"GPT, Claude, Gemini, Llama — confronto e contesto","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Training: pre-training, fine-tuning, RLHF","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"API e integrazione (OpenAI API, Claude API, Google AI)","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"3. Prompt Engineering","block_property":"heading_3"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**Zero-shot**, **Few-shot**, **Chain-of-Thought (CoT)**","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**System prompt**, **User prompt**, **Assistant role**","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Struttura prompt: contesto, task, formato, esempi","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**Tecniche avanzate**: Tree-of-Thought, ReAct, Self-Consistency","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Temperature, top-p, max_tokens — parametri di generazione","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"4. AI nel Cloud","block_property":"heading_3"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**AI-as-a-Service**: OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Vertex AI, AWS Bedrock, Azure OpenAI","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)**: Embedding, vector database (Pinecone, Weaviate, Chroma)","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**AI Agents**: Tool use, function calling, multi-agent systems","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"5. Etica e Best Practices","block_property":"heading_3"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Bias nei modelli, allucinazioni, safety guardrails","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Privacy dei dati (non inviare dati sensibili a API esterne)","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"AI Act EU — regolamentazione","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"⚡ Punti Chiave","block_property":"heading_2"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**Prompt engineering** è la competenza chiave: un buon prompt definisce ruolo, contesto, task e formato","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**Chain-of-Thought** migliora significativamente il ragionamento in task complessi","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**RAG** combina LLM con knowledge base esterna per risposte aggiornate e contestuali","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Parametri critici: **Temperature** (0=deterministico, 0.7=creativo), **Top-p** (nucleus sampling)","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Le **allucinazioni** sono il problema principale — validare sempre output critici","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**Nessun LLM** va usato per decisioni su dati sensibili senza supervisione umana","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"📎 Risorse Collegate","block_property":"heading_2"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**02_Esercizi/**: —","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**03_Progetti/**: —","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**Materie collegate**: `10_Programmazione_Python`, `20_Data_Analytics_Visualization`, `12_RESTful_API`","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}}]}}